# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
varHere is a standard, comprehensive `.gitignore` template for Python projects, configured to ensure `.json` files are never ignored (even if in temporary or build directories).

```gitignore
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
build/
config/
dist/
eggs/
.eggs/
*.egg-info/
*.egg

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
ENV/
.venv/

# Testing and coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.nox/
.tox/

# IDEs and Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Environment variables & secrets
.env
.env.*

# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints

# Explicitly ensure JSON files are tracked across the repository
!*.json
!**/*.json
